    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alisa: The Parting is a spin-off of the critically acclaimed 2021 title: Alisa.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot on the heels of a wanted criminal who stole a set of mysterious blueprints, Alisa and her partner -\u00a0Jean Fran\u00e7ois - scour the countryside in search of their quarry. However, unexpected developments lead to Alisa being engulfed, descending down into the madness of the Dollhouse - and Jean is left with his own mystery and set of questions to answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet all kinds of characters, good and evil, while trying to survive dangerous situations and uncovering the truth about the stolen blueprints... all the while helping out your new &quot;friends&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/24b5573578090f3417f14e1ef3628b15.poster.avif?t=1754370162\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/24b5573578090f3417f14e1ef3628b15.webm?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/24b5573578090f3417f14e1ef3628b15.mp4?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole campaign can be played either Solo with a CPU partner, or in couch co-op mode with a friend (the good kind)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/3694de26380c6b8ff3251b11eee14a9c.poster.avif?t=1754370162\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/3694de26380c6b8ff3251b11eee14a9c.webm?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/3694de26380c6b8ff3251b11eee14a9c.mp4?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa: The Parting provides many avenues for exploration, with a central hub area connecting together the world as you embark on your missions and hunt for the truth. In between adventures, return for a spot of respite, where you can play mini games and complete tiny quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/0a5a17f537cda23aa964eb3470061582.poster.avif?t=1754370162\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/0a5a17f537cda23aa964eb3470061582.webm?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/0a5a17f537cda23aa964eb3470061582.mp4?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than just your standard survival horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real pre-rendered backgrounds and eye-watering cutting edge 320x240 resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tons of unlockable content! Not just weapons and cosmetic outfits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Genuine replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of gameplay variety within the boundaries of the genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- WARNING: high difficulty as a standard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A large variety of enemies and locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surprises around every corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Silly humour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- REALLY good 90's style voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A nostalgic trip to the late 1990s ~ early 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alisa: The Parting is a spin-off of the critically acclaimed 2021 title: Alisa.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot on the heels of a wanted criminal who stole a set of mysterious blueprints, Alisa and her partner -\u00a0Jean Fran\u00e7ois - scour the countryside in search of their quarry. However, unexpected developments lead to Alisa being engulfed, descending down into the madness of the Dollhouse - and Jean is left with his own mystery and set of questions to answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet all kinds of characters, good and evil, while trying to survive dangerous situations and uncovering the truth about the stolen blueprints... all the while helping out your new &quot;friends&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/24b5573578090f3417f14e1ef3628b15.poster.avif?t=1754370162\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/24b5573578090f3417f14e1ef3628b15.webm?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/24b5573578090f3417f14e1ef3628b15.mp4?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole campaign can be played either Solo with a CPU partner, or in couch co-op mode with a friend (the good kind)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/3694de26380c6b8ff3251b11eee14a9c.poster.avif?t=1754370162\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/3694de26380c6b8ff3251b11eee14a9c.webm?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/3694de26380c6b8ff3251b11eee14a9c.mp4?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa: The Parting provides many avenues for exploration, with a central hub area connecting together the world as you embark on your missions and hunt for the truth. In between adventures, return for a spot of respite, where you can play mini games and complete tiny quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/0a5a17f537cda23aa964eb3470061582.poster.avif?t=1754370162\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/0a5a17f537cda23aa964eb3470061582.webm?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547910/extras/0a5a17f537cda23aa964eb3470061582.mp4?t=1754370162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than just your standard survival horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real pre-rendered backgrounds and eye-watering cutting edge 320x240 resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tons of unlockable content! Not just weapons and cosmetic outfits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Genuine replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of gameplay variety within the boundaries of the genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- WARNING: high difficulty as a standard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A large variety of enemies and locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surprises around every corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Silly humour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- REALLY good 90's style voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A nostalgic trip to the late 1990s ~ early 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Alisa: The Parting is an unforgettable action packed adventure, that looks and plays exactly like a late 90's and early 2000's 32bit game. With crispy pixely polygons and pre-rendered backgrounds and cinematics, Alisa: The Parting is enjoyable in both solo and co-op play.",
